      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "下水道的管線堵住了。\n看來是大塊頭的寶可夢造成的。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǅ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 336,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0B6C34905376847BA17DDA58354F4F4E863002000A770B4F86662F5927584A982D76845BF653EF5922902062107684300200100002011401C50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "畢竟是大塊頭的寶可夢，應該不好對付吧。\n所以就輪到<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳出場了。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǅ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 396,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "75627ADF662F5927584A982D76845BF653EF5922FF0C61C98A724E0D597D5C0D4ED854273002000A62404EE55C318F2A523000100003110000FF01014F6059B351FA58344E86300200100002011401C50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我會把可能有寶可夢堵住的地點座標\n傳到<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳的地圖上的，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳再用導航之類的幫我調查啦。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǅ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 480,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62116703628A53EF80FD67095BF653EF592258354F4F768457309EDE5EA76A19000A50B3523000100003110000FF01014F6059B37684573057164E0A7684FF0C00100001BE00000A00100003110000FF01014F6059B3518D75285C0E822A4E4B985E76845E6B62118ABF67E55566300200100002011401C50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 61
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我會把座標傳到<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳的地圖上的，\n<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳再用導航之類的幫我調查啦。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǅ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
