      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "因為寶可夢的反應消失了，\n我就過來了……這傢伙是怎麼回事啊！？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǅ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 860,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "56E070BA5BF653EF5922768453CD61C96D8859314E86FF0C000A62115C31904E4F864E8620262026901950A24F19662F600E9EBC56DE4E8B554AFF01FF1F00100002011401C50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "是吃吼霸啊。\n還真的是大塊頭的寶可夢耶。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǅ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 932,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "662F5403543C9738554A3002000A9084771F7684662F5927584A982D76845BF653EF59228036300200100002011401C50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "……唰啊。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 984,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "202620265530554A30020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "牠是在道歉嗎？不用在意！\n你是想試著鑽過去對吧？我懂啦。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǅ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 996,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7260662F572890536B4955CEFF1F4E0D75285728610FFF01000A4F60662F60F38A668457947D904E53BB5C0D5427FF1F621161C25566300200100002011401C50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "只要你願意，\n就來當我的夥伴吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǅ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1064,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "53EA89814F609858610FFF0C000A5C314F8675766211768459254F345427300200100002011401C50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "在下水道生活的寶可夢也不少。\n有你在的話我就安心了。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǅ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1108,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "57284E0B6C349053751F6D3B76845BF653EF59224E5F4E0D5C113002000A67094F60572876848A7162115C315B895FC34E86300200100002011401C50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "啦唰啊！！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1172,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "55665530554AFF01FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那就這麼決定了！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǅ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1184,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90A35C3190199EBC6C7A5B9A4E86FF0100100002011401C50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "嘿！\n謝謝<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳救了吃吼霸啊。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǅ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1212,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "563FFF01000A8B1D8B1D00100003110000FF01014F6059B365514E865403543C9738554A300200100002011401C50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "好！吃吼霸，\n立刻上工吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǅ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1260,
